  "findings": [
    "No material visual defect observed in painted content compared with approved r57 layout.",
    "Initial WordPress Home 1440 full-page capture omitted painted regions. Three focused viewport captures show the practice and team images painted; the visual evidence gap is resolved.",
    "WordPress About 1440 imagery is painted.",
    "Contact form configuration differs by host: Cloud local receiver and unconfigured WordPress notice.",
    "Existing Home 390 adjacent pale surfaces predate this revision.",
    "Native editor screenshots show the sampled one, three and seven profile states at desktop and mobile, plus the reopened shared-instance style state on each host. Some editor screenshots have selection chrome, transient toasts, or partially clipped canvas content, so they are supporting evidence rather than complete-page render proof."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Static visual review does not establish interaction behavior, release readiness, licensing or user approval."
  ],
